§ `s 34-25 -- base day`

-- c073: Chloe turns 31 on 14 March 2034; her base day is the following 1 July.
#ASSERT `When is my base day` `Chloe's base day facts (c073)` EQUALS `Base day on` 20340701
#ASSERT `When is my base day` `born on 1 July 1995` EQUALS `Base day on` 20270701
#ASSERT `When is my base day` `a migrant born 1 January 1990, Medicare-eligible 15 March 2025` EQUALS `Base day on` 20260315
#ASSERT `When is my base day` `Chloe, if overseas on 1 July 2034 and back on 10 February 2036` EQUALS `Base day on` 20370210
#ASSERT `When is my base day` `someone with a base day before 30 June 2010` EQUALS `My base day on or before 30 June 2010 stands`
#ASSERT `When is my base day` `someone living on Norfolk Island at the final transition time` EQUALS `Not covered by this encoding`

